silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_02_algebra_category_concrete_anchor#colimitalgebra_mittenscolimitapex silm:hasLongDescription "The ColimitAlgebra_MittensColimitApex is ColimitAlgebra_MittensColimitApex: the pair (MittensColimitApex, colimit_alpha: Sigma(MittensColimitApex) -> MittensColimitApex); the Sigma-algebra whose carrier is the colimit apex and whose structure map colimit_alpha assembles the twelve tagged legs into the colimit." .
